<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>About System | AlumniConnect</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-canvas: #F8FAFC;
      --bg-surface: #FFFFFF;
      --bg-subtle: #F1F5F9;
      --text-primary: #0F172A;
      --text-secondary: #475569;
      --text-muted: #94A3B8;
      --brand-primary: #4F46E5;
      --brand-primary-hover: #4338CA;
      --brand-accent: #0284C7;
      --border-subtle: #E2E8F0;
      --font-display: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      --font-sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace;
    }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      background: var(--bg-canvas);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      line-height: 1.65;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .site-nav {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 50;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }
    .nav-inner {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .brand-logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 18px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    .brand-mark {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand-primary), var(--brand-accent));
      color: white;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.25);
    }
    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .nav-links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 13.5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: all 0.18s ease;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text-primary); background: var(--bg-subtle); }
    .nav-links a.active { background: #EEF2FF; color: var(--brand-primary); font-weight: 700; }
    .container {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 36px 24px 64px;
      width: 100%;
      flex: 1;
    }
    .page-header { margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .badge-pill {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #EEF2FF;
      color: var(--brand-primary);
      padding: 5px 14px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .subtitle { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 16px; max-width: 720px; }
    .card {
      background: var(--bg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
    }
    .card h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .card p { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .grid-2 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .feature-list { list-style: none; }
    .feature-list li {
      padding: 10px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bg-subtle);
      font-size: 14.5px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .feature-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    code {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 12.5px;
      background: var(--bg-subtle);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }
    .swatch-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }
    .swatch {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: var(--bg-subtle);
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
    }
    .swatch-dot {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    .site-footer {
      background: var(--bg-surface);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }
    .site-footer a { color: var(--brand-primary); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="site-nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="/" class="brand-logo">
        <span class="brand-mark">🎓</span>
        <span>AlumniConnect</span>
      </a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/users">Users</a>
        <a href="/announcements">Announcements</a>
        <a href="/job-postings">Job Postings</a>
        <a href="/applications">Applications</a>
        <a href="/about" class="active">About</a>
        <a href="/api/swagger">Swagger API</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="container">
    <div class="page-header">
      <span class="badge-pill">🏛️ Architecture, Brand & Design System</span>
      <h1>About AlumniConnect</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        A full-stack university alumni management, bulletin, and career platform built with Node.js (Express), EJS, MySQL 8.0, and Docker Compose.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
        <h2>⚙️ MVC & Middleware Stack</h2>
        <p>Engineered with strict separation of concerns across Models, Views, Controllers, Routes, and Guardian Middlewares:</p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li><span>Database Engine</span> <code>MySQL 8.0 (InnoDB)</code></li>
          <li><span>Migrations & Seeding</span> <code>npm run migrate / seed</code></li>
          <li><span>Terminal Logger Middleware</span> <code>src/middlewares/logger.js</code></li>
          <li><span>404 & 5xx Guardians</span> <code>logs/error.logs</code></li>
          <li><span>OpenAPI 3.0 Spec</span> <code>GET /api/swagger</code></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
        <h2>🎨 Brand & Design System (`brand.md` & `DESIGN.md`)</h2>
        <p>Designed following the 9-section <strong>VoltAgent/awesome-design-md</strong> standard and <strong>styles.refero.design</strong> references:</p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li><span>Brand Identity Spec</span> <code>brand.md</code></li>
          <li><span>Design System Spec</span> <code>DESIGN.md</code></li>
          <li><span>Data Design Doc</span> <code>DDD.md</code></li>
          <li><span>Typography</span> <code>Plus Jakarta Sans & Inter</code></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="swatch-row">
          <span class="swatch"><span class="swatch-dot" style="background:#0F172A"></span>#0F172A</span>
          <span class="swatch"><span class="swatch-dot" style="background:#4F46E5"></span>#4F46E5</span>
          <span class="swatch"><span class="swatch-dot" style="background:#0284C7"></span>#0284C7</span>
          <span class="swatch"><span class="swatch-dot" style="background:#059669"></span>#059669</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    AlumniConnect — University Alumni & Career Network ·
    <a href="/">← Back to Home</a> · <a href="/api/health">API Health</a> · <a href="/api/swagger">Swagger Docs</a>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
